{"game": "sniper-elite-resistance", "language": "english", "appid": 2169200, "month": "2026-07", "window": 2, "start_date": 1783468800, "end_date": 1784159999, "month_true_total": 106, "quota": 8, "returned": 8, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 09:05:34 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "230527260", "author": {"steamid": "76561198050489503", "personaname": "YeloSquit", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198050489503/", "num_games_owned": 44, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1823, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1708, "last_played": 1784126123, "avatar": "f05078aef280b9317cafb9c8c69accaf68b28da3"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game lets you feel like a tactical genius even when you’re actually just crawling in bushes and praying enemies don’t see you. Resistance has that perfect mix of “I’m a master assassin” and “I tripped over my own landmine.” The maps are great, the sniping feels crisp, and the kill cams make me laugh way too hard. Casual friendly, chaos friendly, and perfect for people who enjoy tactical stupidity. Solid game.", "timestamp_created": 1784117111, "timestamp_updated": 1784117111, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.587568223476409912", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "230520943", "author": {"steamid": "76561198029598941", "personaname": "peterstone181", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198029598941/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 15975, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 12, "playtime_at_review": 14723, "last_played": 1791030359, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "not bad", "timestamp_created": 1784109922, "timestamp_updated": 1784109922, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "230519888", "author": {"steamid": "76561198023045274", "personaname": "Nathan Brown", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198023045274/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 320, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 320, "last_played": 1784108551, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Class game", "timestamp_created": 1784108613, "timestamp_updated": 1784108613, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "230472966", "author": {"steamid": "76561198093804595", "personaname": "Bcav712", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198093804595/", "num_games_owned": 246, "num_reviews": 134, "playtime_forever": 5007, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4636, "last_played": 1784073654, "avatar": "a7edb58551f87c20066e7a09df831ac7d200988c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Ever since this game released I always had a negative look towards it because it just looked like SE5 dlc. Don't get me wrong it is basically SE5 but I'm surprised that I actually like this game better.\n\nThe campaign and dlc maps are leagues better than 5's in my opinion, way better for sniping. The roster of guns in this game I prefer, with more iconic WW2 weapons like the BAR and M! Garand. There are also many unique weapons that you don't see in many games.\n\nGame ran very well at all High settings, not maxed out just because I prefer higher fps.\n\nMy only \"complaint\" with this game is that you don't play as Karl Fairburne. He is John Sniper Elite and a SE game not focused on him is like playing a DOOM game where you don't play as the DOOM Guy.\n\nWith all this said I do recommend this game especially if you like SE5. I bought the complete edition for $40 on sale and I'd say it was well worth it.", "timestamp_created": 1784051332, "timestamp_updated": 1784051332, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.583858728408813477", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32542", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700K", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 Ti", "vram_size": 8017}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "230430622", "author": {"steamid": "76561197967118115", "personaname": "xysea", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197967118115/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 4143, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3442, "last_played": 1787369082, "avatar": "3604ac34b47c87e187d151f22aa17e107253ce34"}, "language": "english", "review": "EXCELLENT GAMEPLAY", "timestamp_created": 1784002324, "timestamp_updated": 1784002324, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "230421753", "author": {"steamid": "76561198274007780", "personaname": "Hey! It's Me!", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198274007780/", "num_games_owned": 131, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 108, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 108, "last_played": 1783990722, "avatar": "b14b22c0479effac43ea353790c7877ac312c78c"}, "language": "english", "review": "meh, these games are the same rehashed reskin and they are all terribly clunky, at least tarkov feels clunky for a reason, trash as that is too, still better than this, and the snap on the ladders is atrocious as hell. not my thing but like, if you wanna snipe and spend the cash on a rehash, go ahead", "timestamp_created": 1783990853, "timestamp_updated": 1783990853, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "230401929", "author": {"steamid": "76561198695372238", "personaname": "Gunslinger_4_5", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/4814664/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 3946, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 189, "playtime_at_review": 360, "last_played": 1790901179, "avatar": "08fa5829cd640dafed8d94de1e117e321eeaba39"}, "language": "english", "review": "very fun  game", "timestamp_created": 1783969733, "timestamp_updated": 1783969733, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "230390514", "author": {"steamid": "76561199064787285", "personaname": "Muddy™", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profi